Q: Given an array arr[]. The task is to find the largest element and return it.


class Solution {
    public static int largest(int[] arr) {
        int max = arr[0];
        
        for(int i=1; i<arr.length; i++) {
            if(arr[i] > max) {
                max = arr[i];  
            }
        }
        return max;
    }
}

OUTPUT:
[1, 8, 7, 56, 40]
56
